<title>USA: Prime Capital names CFO.</title>
<headline>Prime Capital names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Capital Corp said Wednesday that Vern Landeck, treasurer, was named chief financial officer effective July 7.</p>
<p>Prime also said that assistant treasurer Jeannene Walker has been promoted to the position of treasurer.  </p>
<p>&quot;With his directly relevant experience in all aspects of loan and lease finance, Vern Landeck is well prepared to assume the responsibilities of chief financial officer,&quot; James Friedman, chairman, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Prime Capital is a large, independent provider of capital and specialty finance services to health care and other industries.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
